Ahh!

533
01:00:13,216 --> 01:00:14,451
[Episode 3 Preview]

534
01:00:14,451 --> 01:00:19,901
I'm sorry. I'm flattered,
but I already have someone I like...

535
01:00:19,901 --> 01:00:23,236
There's no room for you... I'm sorry!

536
01:00:23,236 --> 01:00:25,153
Does that make any sense?

537
01:00:25,153 --> 01:00:27,172
[A misunderstanding created love]

538
01:00:27,172 --> 01:00:28,341
Hey.

539
01:00:28,341 --> 01:00:29,380
Do you have a brother?

540
01:00:29,380 --> 01:00:32,560
- No.
- Want to be mine?

541
01:00:34,323 --> 01:00:37,726
Sure. I'll be your little bro.

542
01:00:39,691 --> 01:00:41,749
[I didn't believe in love]

543
01:00:41,749 --> 01:00:43,882
Minju and Yun can't swim!

544
01:00:44,182 --> 01:00:50,074
How long did the doctor say I have to live?
I heard that I was dying.

545
01:00:50,149 --> 01:00:53,722
Did you eat? It seems like you haven't.

546
01:00:53,722 --> 01:00:55,891
Do you know anyone in Korea?
